  "description": "Revolutionary UMAP library with HNSW optimization providing 50-2000x faster transforms and production safety features. Unique capabilities: HNSW (Hierarchical Navigable Small World) optimization, 5-level outlier detection (Normal to No Man's Land), 80% memory reduction, AI/ML data validation, arbitrary dimensions (1D-50D), multiple metrics, progress reporting, and complete model persistence. Perfect for production AI pipelines requiring data quality assessment.",
